  "description": "Fast, low-memory reading and writing of csv, Excel (.xlsx) and OpenDocument (.ods) files, with no dependencies. Read: profile every column over every row, map columns to your fields, validate, and import typed rows or errors that name their row and column; detects csv encoding and delimiter, repairs malformed quoting, reads zip, tar and gzip archives, bounds hostile input. Write: csv, xlsx, ods and a zip of csv sheets, streamed asynchronously into any stream in flat memory, with typed columns, cell styles, frozen headers and auto-filters; a value a format cannot hold exactly is refused, never rounded.",
